  39:CANopen/CANopen.c ****  * - calculate indexes: CO_RX_IDX_xx and CO_TX_IDX_xx
  40:CANopen/CANopen.c ****  * - calculate total count of CAN message buffers: CO_CNT_ALL_RX_MSGS and CO_CNT_ALL_TX_MSGS. */
