  61:CANopen/301/CO_Emergency.h ****  * CO_CONFIG_EM_ERR_STATUS_BITS_COUNT bits. Meaning for each bit is described by @ref CO_EM_errorSt
  62:CANopen/301/CO_Emergency.h ****  * error condition can be reset by CO_errorReset() function. In that case Emergency message is sent
  63:CANopen/301/CO_Emergency.h ****  * indication.
  64:CANopen/301/CO_Emergency.h ****  *
  65:CANopen/301/CO_Emergency.h ****  * Some error conditions are informative and some are critical. Critical error conditions set the c
  66:CANopen/301/CO_Emergency.h ****  * @ref CO_errorRegister_t. Critical error conditions for generic error are specified by @ref
  67:CANopen/301/CO_Emergency.h ****  * CO_CONFIG_ERR_CONDITION_GENERIC macro. Similar macros are defined for other error bits in in @re
  68:CANopen/301/CO_Emergency.h ****  *
